## User Authentication (Entra) and API Access

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User (Browser)
  participant FE as Frontend Web App (App Service)
  participant Entra as Microsoft Entra ID
  participant BE as Backend API (Container App)
  participant JWKS as Entra JWKS Endpoint

  U->>FE: GET /

  alt App Service Authentication (EasyAuth) enabled on FE
    FE-->>U: 302 Redirect to Entra login
    U->>Entra: Login + consent (OIDC)
    Entra-->>U: Redirect back (session established)
    U->>FE: GET / (authenticated session)
    Note over U,FE: UI loads and can optionally request tokens for backend calls (TBD)
  else SPA auth (MSAL) in the browser
    U->>FE: Load React app
    U->>Entra: Auth code + PKCE (OIDC/OAuth2)
    Entra-->>U: id_token/access_token
  else No-auth / dev mode
    Note over U,FE: AUTH_ENABLED=false (repo default in infra/main.bicep)
  end

  U->>BE: HTTPS API call (Authorization: Bearer <token> if enabled)
  BE->>JWKS: Fetch signing keys (if validating tokens)
  JWKS-->>BE: JWKS
  BE-->>U: API response (x-trace-id)
```

## Token Propagation: Backend -> MCP -> Backend (Finance/QBO)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User (Browser)
  participant FE as Frontend UI
  participant BE as Backend Orchestrator
  participant AF as agent_framework Agent
  participant MCP as MCP Server (/mcp)
  participant BE2 as Backend API (QBO/Review endpoints)

  U->>FE: Submit task
  FE->>BE: POST /api/v4/process_request (Bearer token optional)
  BE-->>FE: run_id + websocket process_id

  Note over BE: Stores user token for tool calls (orchestration_config)
  BE->>AF: Execute plan and agent steps
  AF->>MCP: Invoke MCP tool (headers: x-user-auth-token + Authorization)

  alt MCP auth enabled
    MCP->>MCP: Validate JWT (JWKS/issuer/audience)
  else MCP auth disabled
    Note over MCP: ENABLE_AUTH=false (repo default in infra/main.bicep)
  end

  MCP->>BE2: Call backend (e.g., /api/qbo/data/*) using forwarded user token
  BE2-->>MCP: JSON response
  MCP-->>AF: Tool result
  AF-->>BE: Agent output
  BE-->>FE: Stream status via websocket
  FE-->>U: Render progress + final result
```

## QBO OAuth2 (Intuit) Connect Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User (Browser)
  participant FE as Frontend UI
  participant BE as Backend API (/api/qbo/*)
  participant Cosmos as Cosmos DB
  participant Intuit as Intuit OAuth/QBO

  U->>FE: Click "Connect QuickBooks"
  FE->>BE: GET /api/qbo/connect/prepare?client_id=...
  BE->>Cosmos: Save oauth_state (state + user_principal_id + redirect_uri)
  BE-->>FE: authorization_url
  FE-->>U: Navigate to Intuit authorize URL (state)

  U->>Intuit: Login + consent
  Intuit-->>U: Redirect to BE callback (code, realmId, state)

  U->>BE: GET /api/qbo/callback?code=...&realmId=...&state=...
  BE->>Cosmos: Read + delete oauth_state, verify user binding
  BE->>Intuit: Exchange code for tokens
  Intuit-->>BE: access_token + refresh_token + expires_in
  BE->>Cosmos: Upsert qbo_client refresh_token (keyed by user + client_id)
  BE-->>U: JSON callback result
  U->>FE: Frontend callback stores event and returns to home
```
